WEBVTT

01:18.710 --> 01:21.750
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.850 --> 01:24.750
[Episode 11]

01:25.360 --> 01:26.280
You're back.

01:27.260 --> 01:28.930
Look how happy you are.

01:30.110 --> 01:32.800
You two really, really must

01:32.800 --> 01:33.930
stay happy forever.

01:35.440 --> 01:36.840
Congratulations again.

01:37.180 --> 01:38.240
-Cheers.
-Come on.

01:39.450 --> 01:40.200
Cheers.

01:57.610 --> 01:58.270
Wake up.

02:09.960 --> 02:10.440
Hold on.

02:11.170 --> 02:12.510
You don't need to go up there.

02:12.510 --> 02:13.510
Everyone at He Jing Securities

02:13.510 --> 02:14.350
has gone home.

02:17.020 --> 02:19.530
How did you know I was about to
go to He Jing Securities?

02:19.530 --> 02:20.570
I'm not the only one who knows.

02:20.570 --> 02:22.700
By tomorrow, every security guard
in the building will know too.

02:22.700 --> 02:23.670
Without an invitation,

02:23.670 --> 02:25.800
you won't be able to come in here again.

02:28.050 --> 02:29.700
This is so annoying.

02:30.250 --> 02:32.250
I told him he could join the guild

02:30.990 --> 02:33.280
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

02:32.280 --> 02:33.579
once he got all the equipment.

02:33.579 --> 02:35.420
Yet he still came to my workplace
to corner me.

02:35.420 --> 02:36.820
Is he crazy or something?

02:37.470 --> 02:38.470
But he doesn't look like

02:38.470 --> 02:40.180
someone with bad intentions.

02:40.810 --> 02:42.220
Has it ever occurred to you

02:42.220 --> 02:43.470
that he came not for the equipment,

02:42.570 --> 02:44.510
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

02:43.470 --> 02:44.400
but to see you?

02:44.750 --> 02:45.470
See me? Why?

02:45.720 --> 02:47.250
Like a fan chasing his idol?

02:47.280 --> 02:49.810
Silly girl, I think
he's trying to pursue you.

02:51.230 --> 02:52.720
In his dreams.

02:53.030 --> 02:54.240
You'd better believe it.

02:54.240 --> 02:55.829
You really have a thing for her?

02:55.829 --> 02:58.990
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

02:57.030 --> 02:57.880
Yeah.

02:58.060 --> 02:59.720
Then is she interested in you?

03:00.660 --> 03:02.190
We haven't even spoken yet.

03:02.740 --> 03:04.200
It's okay. No need to rush.

03:04.230 --> 03:04.990
Take it slow.

03:05.790 --> 03:06.650
Listen to me on this.

03:06.550 --> 03:08.590
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

03:06.910 --> 03:08.840
You must pursue her relentlessly.

03:09.100 --> 03:10.220
Girls

03:10.240 --> 03:11.820
just love persistent guys.

03:13.880 --> 03:14.740
Really?

03:15.510 --> 03:17.110
Okay, I'll take your advice.

03:18.290 --> 03:21.200
Then have you been pursuing
your landlady persistently?

03:21.200 --> 03:22.730
Didn't you tell me last time

03:22.960 --> 03:24.240
that you like her?

03:25.630 --> 03:27.630
Our situations aren't the same.

03:28.350 --> 03:29.079
I...

03:30.410 --> 03:32.620
Well, we're
at completely different stages,

03:32.620 --> 03:33.250
you know?

03:34.350 --> 03:36.550
Why is it different when it comes to you?

03:37.140 --> 03:38.810
My goal is very clear now.

03:40.810 --> 03:42.670
I just want to keep living here.

03:42.829 --> 03:44.480
Live here peacefully

03:45.450 --> 03:47.380
and happily.

03:47.900 --> 03:49.400
If I don't get kicked out,

03:49.420 --> 03:50.560
I win.

03:50.579 --> 03:51.680
That's my victory.

03:52.060 --> 03:53.430
That humble?

03:53.570 --> 03:55.140
Young Master Li, is this really you?

03:55.140 --> 03:56.420
The love expert?

03:57.230 --> 03:57.829
Wrong.

03:58.860 --> 04:00.260
This isn't being humble.

04:00.570 --> 04:03.980
This is called
knowing the situation and acting wisely.

04:05.570 --> 04:06.250
Fine.

04:38.550 --> 04:39.540
Holy mother!

04:41.420 --> 04:42.480
What are you doing?

04:42.610 --> 04:44.900
You nearly scared the wits out of me,
and now you're teasing me?

04:44.900 --> 04:46.900
You screamed "Mother" first, okay?

04:48.270 --> 04:49.560
Why are you sitting here

04:49.560 --> 04:50.830
in the dark at night?

04:52.560 --> 04:54.040
I was thinking...

04:56.630 --> 04:57.710
Why is it...

04:59.310 --> 05:00.310
that people never

05:00.830 --> 05:03.360
just follow the route
their GPS sets for them?

05:03.750 --> 05:05.680
They all drift off course somehow.

05:06.070 --> 05:07.750
Some want to go east

05:07.980 --> 05:09.290
but end up north.

05:10.510 --> 05:12.310
And those who want to fall in love

05:12.430 --> 05:14.290
end up pursuing careers instead.

05:14.750 --> 05:16.210
Yet those who want to
focus on their careers

05:16.210 --> 05:17.740
end up stuck in family life.

05:17.830 --> 05:18.960
Isn't that strange?

05:19.560 --> 05:20.510
Not at all.

05:20.770 --> 05:22.100
It's just a traffic jam.

05:22.480 --> 05:24.920
Since there's a jam,
just take another route.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.760
The GPS will eventually

05:26.790 --> 05:28.650
get us to our destination, right?

05:28.750 --> 05:30.790
There's no such thing as
"going off course" in life.

05:30.790 --> 05:32.050
There really isn't.

05:32.280 --> 05:34.630
Because where we're all ultimately going

05:34.659 --> 05:36.120
is surprisingly the same.

05:37.260 --> 05:38.620
Really? Where?

05:38.780 --> 05:39.940
The graveyard.

05:41.090 --> 05:42.750
However you live it,
it's still one lifetime, isn't it?

05:42.750 --> 05:45.040
Taking a few detours
and seeing more scenery along the way—

05:45.040 --> 05:45.970
isn't that nice?

05:49.620 --> 05:51.820
Alright, that's all for today's class.

05:52.140 --> 05:54.470
This pays for the dinner
you cooked for me.

05:55.050 --> 05:55.710
Good night.

06:14.520 --> 06:15.770
I knew it!

06:22.160 --> 06:23.160
I'm doomed.

06:23.560 --> 06:25.190
I'm doomed. I'm doomed.

06:48.250 --> 06:55.190
[Please wash them after finishing,
or no more food next time.]

07:04.440 --> 07:05.440
You remember now?

07:08.120 --> 07:08.710
Well,

07:08.710 --> 07:11.710
you wrote
"Please wash them after finishing," right?

07:12.040 --> 07:14.240
I haven't finished the food yet, right?

07:14.780 --> 07:16.000
It'd be such a waste to throw
the food away just to wash the containers.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.000
A waste of food.

07:18.950 --> 07:19.640
What?

07:20.040 --> 07:20.680
No, well.

07:20.770 --> 07:22.720
W-Washing these is such a waste of time,

07:22.720 --> 07:23.190
right?

07:23.190 --> 07:24.270
Can we switch to

07:24.270 --> 07:25.620
disposable containers from now on?

07:25.620 --> 07:27.750
Not eco-friendly and a waste of money.

07:28.190 --> 07:29.040
Well, seriously, why are you

07:29.040 --> 07:29.940
so lazy?

07:30.360 --> 07:31.310
Can't you wash them yourself?

07:31.310 --> 07:33.570
I'll walk you through it hands-on today.

07:39.390 --> 07:40.650
We're going to be late.

07:41.280 --> 07:43.010
We won't make it in time, right?

07:44.110 --> 07:44.970
How about this?

07:45.260 --> 07:45.990
Take my car.

07:46.010 --> 07:47.700
Free ride, no charge,

07:47.720 --> 07:49.580
and you definitely won't be late.

07:50.620 --> 07:52.080
You'd really be that nice?

07:52.510 --> 07:54.510
I've always been a very nice person.

07:54.920 --> 07:56.450
But I do have some flaws too.

07:57.110 --> 07:59.240
I've never liked washing dishes
since I was a kid,

07:59.240 --> 08:00.510
and even now that I'm older,

08:00.510 --> 08:02.370
I still don't feel like learning.

08:02.710 --> 08:03.660
But I can drive.

08:06.010 --> 08:06.600
Got it.

08:06.830 --> 08:08.630
Leave them here. I'll wash them.

08:09.740 --> 08:10.420
Let's go.

08:30.430 --> 08:31.000
Please.

08:31.870 --> 08:32.799
Hold on, hold on.

08:35.909 --> 08:37.750
You have to gently lean down like this

08:37.750 --> 08:39.039
to get in the car.

08:39.070 --> 08:39.950
See? Try it again.

08:39.950 --> 08:40.419
Come on.

08:40.470 --> 08:42.400
You think we're shooting a TV show?

08:43.230 --> 08:44.430
Just get in and drive.

08:54.920 --> 08:56.520
Is it really necessary
to get in the car like that?

08:56.520 --> 08:57.560
What do you know?

08:58.370 --> 08:59.570
That's called style.

09:00.880 --> 09:01.680
Seatbelt.

09:01.910 --> 09:02.510
Buckle up.

09:06.510 --> 09:07.310
Sit tight.

09:09.760 --> 09:11.030
Are you crazy?

09:17.420 --> 09:18.340
Listen,

09:19.630 --> 09:20.680
starting today,

09:20.710 --> 09:22.490
I'll cover all the disposable containers.

09:22.490 --> 09:24.160
That way you won't waste time
washing dishes.

09:24.160 --> 09:25.020
No, no.

09:25.130 --> 09:27.480
I said I was going to teach you
how to save money.

09:27.480 --> 09:28.170
Yes.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.850
And the first rule is

09:29.930 --> 09:32.480
to avoid all disposable items

09:32.500 --> 09:34.060
and use reusable ones.

09:38.630 --> 09:40.390
I think this car is pretty good.

09:40.390 --> 09:41.240
It's nice.

09:41.240 --> 09:42.870
Much better than the previous one.

09:42.870 --> 09:44.020
How so?

09:44.210 --> 09:46.140
It's smaller, so it uses less fuel.

09:48.150 --> 09:48.840
Anyway,

09:48.840 --> 09:50.530
all cars are the same to me.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.550
The most important thing is

09:51.550 --> 09:53.850
that it has to be fuel-efficient, right?

09:54.090 --> 09:56.170
So the second rule of saving money is

09:56.260 --> 09:57.570
transportation.

09:58.600 --> 09:59.670
It's so expensive.

09:59.690 --> 10:00.610
You should be like me

10:00.610 --> 10:02.140
and take public transport.

10:03.040 --> 10:04.470
Take the subway or bus.

10:11.160 --> 10:11.780
Come on.

10:12.510 --> 10:12.960
You

10:13.210 --> 10:15.110
really don't know how to wash dishes?

10:15.110 --> 10:15.660
Yeah.

10:16.890 --> 10:19.670
You were definitely spoiled as a kid.

10:19.840 --> 10:21.200
Well, you're not exactly a rich kid,

10:21.200 --> 10:22.100
so how do you not

10:22.130 --> 10:23.950
have the most basic life skill like that?

10:23.950 --> 10:25.110
Hold on, hold on.

10:25.540 --> 10:27.170
How am I not a rich kid?

10:30.210 --> 10:31.030
Fine, fine.

10:31.060 --> 10:32.310
You are a rich kid.

10:32.480 --> 10:33.550
You, a rich kid,

10:33.570 --> 10:34.960
don't rent a place of your own

10:34.960 --> 10:36.200
but share an apartment with someone else.

10:36.200 --> 10:38.100
You're always broke
and borrow other people's cars

10:38.100 --> 10:38.960
instead of buying your own.

10:38.960 --> 10:41.360
You live paycheck to paycheck
and wear knockoffs.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.850
A broke rich kid.

10:44.610 --> 10:46.030
Is that how you see me?

10:46.790 --> 10:48.720
Does it matter how I see you?

10:48.740 --> 10:49.600
What matters is

10:49.800 --> 10:52.080
that you care way too much about
what other people think.

10:52.080 --> 10:53.400
That's why you keep buying stuff,

10:53.400 --> 10:54.440
trying to

10:54.460 --> 10:56.320
prop up your self-confidence
with external things.

10:56.320 --> 10:57.560
Am I right?

11:00.030 --> 11:02.210
Fine. It seems in your eyes,

11:02.230 --> 11:03.960
I'll never make it as a rich kid.

11:04.670 --> 11:06.170
But don't be discouraged.

11:06.190 --> 11:08.300
I believe with my help,

11:08.320 --> 11:10.580
and a little more effort on your part,

11:10.660 --> 11:13.980
you can absolutely become
a self-made, first-gen rich man.

11:13.980 --> 11:15.040
Alright, alright.

11:15.480 --> 11:16.810
The third rule is

11:16.840 --> 11:17.320
to...

11:18.480 --> 11:20.430
stop eating out.

11:20.450 --> 11:22.170
Do you know how expensive that is?

11:22.170 --> 11:23.420
Cooking at home saves

11:23.470 --> 11:24.560
so much money.

11:24.600 --> 11:27.000
Don't eat out. It's too costly.

11:28.630 --> 11:30.220
Right, you can't cook.

11:30.250 --> 11:31.290
You don't have that skill.

11:31.290 --> 11:32.850
So you get a pass on that one.

11:33.500 --> 11:35.190
It's fine. I can't cook,

11:35.210 --> 11:36.360
but you can, right?

11:36.530 --> 11:38.040
You have to cook anyway, right?

11:38.040 --> 11:39.640
You can just make a little extra...

11:39.640 --> 11:40.450
Stop the car.

11:40.470 --> 11:41.360
What's wrong?

11:41.860 --> 11:43.060
Pull over, pull over.

11:45.290 --> 11:46.890
Um, Shan Li Fang is just ahead.

11:46.730 --> 11:50.260
[Parking]

11:46.920 --> 11:48.130
I can still make it if I run.

11:48.130 --> 11:49.210
I'll get off here.

11:49.230 --> 11:51.980
That way, no one sees me
getting out of your car

11:52.000 --> 11:54.040
and thinks there's something going on
between us.

11:54.040 --> 11:56.770
What would be going on?
I'm just giving you a ride.

11:58.310 --> 11:59.670
Then thank you, driver.

12:03.400 --> 12:05.240
Look at you—so tomboyish!

12:04.630 --> 12:05.860
[Non-Motorized Vehicle Parking]

12:07.170 --> 12:08.770
Stop the car! Did you hear me?

12:15.320 --> 12:16.630
Li Yifei, how old are you?

12:16.630 --> 12:18.030
What are you, a grade schooler?

12:18.030 --> 12:19.750
Look at how uncoordinated you are.

12:19.750 --> 12:20.890
You...

12:21.840 --> 12:23.340
Are you crazy?

12:28.840 --> 12:29.750
Director Fang.

12:40.340 --> 12:42.550
Cui will be responsible for
the presentation.

12:42.550 --> 12:43.400
Two days.

12:43.420 --> 12:44.710
I need it in two days.

12:44.990 --> 12:45.510
Okay.

12:45.890 --> 12:47.450
Since we've helped Shan Li Fang Group

12:47.450 --> 12:48.830
find such a major loophole,

12:48.830 --> 12:50.800
we'll be counting on all of you
to solve this.

12:50.800 --> 12:52.400
Mr. Li, do you have anything to add?

12:52.400 --> 12:52.970
No.

12:53.720 --> 12:55.490
Then that wraps up
today's morning meeting.

12:55.490 --> 12:57.290
Everyone, keep up the hard work.

12:58.070 --> 12:58.930
Director Fang.

13:00.830 --> 13:03.010
You haven't assigned me anything yet.

13:30.780 --> 13:31.500
Dai Xi.

13:31.570 --> 13:33.430
Is there anything I can help with?

13:33.870 --> 13:35.470
For now...

13:36.120 --> 13:38.100
there's nothing I need.

13:38.120 --> 13:39.520
Just take a break for now.

13:39.930 --> 13:41.560
Then let me know if you need anything.

13:41.560 --> 13:41.990
Okay.

13:45.170 --> 13:45.960
Mr. Cui,

13:46.450 --> 13:48.830
do you need me to
help prepare the presentation?

13:48.830 --> 13:49.710
Not for now.

13:49.740 --> 13:51.410
I'll let you know when I do.

13:55.260 --> 13:56.660
Special Assistant Qian?

13:58.130 --> 13:59.530
Special Assistant Qian!

13:59.600 --> 14:00.130
Here!

14:02.010 --> 14:04.540
This isn't school.
Why are you saying "here"?

14:04.970 --> 14:06.670
I have a very tricky task for you

14:06.670 --> 14:07.400
right now.

14:07.550 --> 14:08.280
Come with me.

14:11.760 --> 14:13.450
What's wrong? What is it?

14:15.200 --> 14:17.400
Pour me a glass of water. I'm so thirsty.

14:18.180 --> 14:19.710
Can't you pour it yourself?

14:22.520 --> 14:23.160
Come in.

14:25.090 --> 14:26.240
Here's your water.

14:28.160 --> 14:28.850
Come back.

14:30.660 --> 14:32.770
What's wrong? Is there anything else?

14:32.770 --> 14:34.910
You walked off
before the boss even finished speaking.

14:34.910 --> 14:36.790
You really have no social awareness.

14:36.790 --> 14:37.650
Close the door.

14:45.150 --> 14:45.600
Sit.

15:00.840 --> 15:02.120
Do you know why Director Fang

15:02.120 --> 15:03.200
is sidelining you?

15:05.300 --> 15:08.100
Whether she accepts my apology or not,

15:08.800 --> 15:11.200
I've already
prepared myself for the worst.

15:11.200 --> 15:13.850
I'm already very grateful
that she didn't tell me to get lost

15:13.850 --> 15:15.210
in front of everyone today.

15:15.210 --> 15:16.140
Grateful?

15:19.570 --> 15:22.130
You honestly think her keeping you around

15:22.760 --> 15:23.780
is a good thing?

15:25.670 --> 15:26.600
I'm telling you,

15:26.610 --> 15:28.770
the best way to ruin someone

15:30.550 --> 15:31.750
is to leave them idle.

15:35.100 --> 15:36.010
There's nothing we can do.

15:36.010 --> 15:38.940
I'm with you on
exposing Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's

15:38.960 --> 15:39.960
financial fraud,

15:40.270 --> 15:42.110
but I don't agree with the way

15:42.130 --> 15:44.460
you blew everything wide open all at once.

15:45.100 --> 15:46.380
No matter who it is,

15:46.550 --> 15:47.570
no one wants their subordinates

15:47.570 --> 15:48.770
to act so recklessly.

15:51.220 --> 15:53.500
Still, I'm a little curious.

15:54.630 --> 15:56.160
Knowing your personality,

15:56.410 --> 15:57.480
you should've secretly

15:57.480 --> 16:00.000
prepared a backup plan
to hand it to Fang Yun

16:00.000 --> 16:02.110
and then surprise all of us.

16:02.170 --> 16:02.800
So?

16:03.480 --> 16:04.810
What have you prepared?

16:07.140 --> 16:08.540
If I were

16:08.700 --> 16:11.240
a powerful woman
who could handle whatever comes her way,

16:11.240 --> 16:14.720
I wouldn't be getting sidelined
by my boss and colleagues right now.

16:14.720 --> 16:17.090
I was just taking things
one step at a time,

16:18.480 --> 16:20.050
but I forgot

16:20.190 --> 16:21.450
that hitting a dead end

16:22.910 --> 16:25.710
would end up burdening
the people walking with me.

16:29.040 --> 16:29.800
Alright.

16:30.660 --> 16:32.290
If you ever need help in the future,

16:32.290 --> 16:33.360
just let me know.

16:33.390 --> 16:35.790
I'm basically the office gofer now anyway.

16:55.180 --> 16:55.810
Zhao,

16:56.020 --> 16:57.820
set up a meeting
with Chairman Liao for me.

16:57.820 --> 16:59.620
I need to do some damage control.

18:01.880 --> 18:03.490
Chairman, you're really amazing.

18:03.490 --> 18:05.290
You're quite amazing yourself.

18:07.640 --> 18:08.830
I was only joking.

18:09.680 --> 18:11.080
How could someone my daughter likes

18:11.080 --> 18:12.040
not be amazing?

18:14.660 --> 18:16.240
I asked you to play golf with me

18:16.240 --> 18:18.170
because I think you're a smart man.

18:19.430 --> 18:20.890
Shiyu has high standards.

18:21.480 --> 18:22.730
She wouldn't choose who she likes

18:22.730 --> 18:25.060
based on superficial, worldly criteria.

18:25.470 --> 18:26.230
As for me,

18:27.340 --> 18:28.940
I believe in capable people.

18:29.670 --> 18:31.190
Given a big enough stage,

18:31.280 --> 18:33.040
they will shine brightly.

18:36.360 --> 18:37.950
Before, you didn't have the opportunity.

18:37.950 --> 18:39.010
That was your fate.

18:39.320 --> 18:40.410
Now that fortune has come,

18:40.410 --> 18:41.560
you must seize it.

18:42.320 --> 18:44.180
Yes, Chairman. That's very true.

18:46.680 --> 18:48.010
I've given you the opportunity,

18:48.010 --> 18:50.620
but I haven't seen your capability yet.

18:53.220 --> 18:54.470
The pre-IPO materials

18:54.470 --> 18:56.230
for our Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

18:57.080 --> 18:59.080
were flagged by the joint sponsor team

18:59.080 --> 19:01.140
for discrepancies in the asset data.

19:03.550 --> 19:04.750
I'm sorry, Chairman.

19:04.850 --> 19:06.410
I was in charge of this matter.

19:06.410 --> 19:08.570
It's entirely my fault that I didn't catch

19:08.570 --> 19:09.770
such a huge loophole.

19:11.530 --> 19:12.570
Young man,

19:13.540 --> 19:15.220
don't take the blame for something
that isn't your fault.

19:15.220 --> 19:16.230
Covering for someone

19:16.230 --> 19:18.360
doesn't mean they will appreciate it.

19:22.050 --> 19:23.070
Who would dare to

19:23.220 --> 19:24.610
falsify those financial statements

19:24.610 --> 19:25.810
without my approval?

19:29.470 --> 19:31.000
What disappoints me is that,

19:31.000 --> 19:32.880
as someone Shiyu has chosen,

19:33.460 --> 19:35.770
you were the last
to know there was a problem.

19:35.770 --> 19:36.470
Do you know?

19:37.090 --> 19:38.650
The original financial data

19:38.650 --> 19:40.430
of our hotel group headquarters

19:40.430 --> 19:42.490
was uncovered by that girl, Qian Fei.

19:43.140 --> 19:43.940
Qian Fei?

19:47.430 --> 19:49.360
That name rings a bell, doesn't it?

19:50.660 --> 19:52.770
That young woman is something.

19:55.620 --> 19:58.220
She wasn't the only one
who knew about all this.

19:58.410 --> 19:59.640
Her brilliance lies in

19:59.640 --> 20:01.020
knowing how to find the right moment.

20:01.020 --> 20:02.220
She chose an occasion

20:02.400 --> 20:03.390
where no one could

20:03.390 --> 20:05.430
suppress it
and exposed everything all at once.

20:05.430 --> 20:06.760
Even an old hand like me

20:07.140 --> 20:09.000
was caught completely off guard.

20:09.560 --> 20:11.360
Please rest assured, Chairman.

20:11.390 --> 20:13.490
I'll do everything in my power
to make up for this.

20:13.490 --> 20:14.760
I heard that woman, Qian Fei,

20:14.760 --> 20:15.960
was fired by us before

20:16.090 --> 20:17.360
and then used every means possible

20:17.360 --> 20:20.490
to get herself onto the project team
for our hotel group.

20:21.350 --> 20:23.210
Who knows who she's really after?

20:31.140 --> 20:31.850
Well,

20:32.970 --> 20:35.300
she only disrupted some of my minor plans.

20:36.660 --> 20:37.720
It doesn't matter.

20:39.620 --> 20:41.820
Nothing matters except life and death.

20:44.130 --> 20:45.040
I believe...

20:49.460 --> 20:51.190
you have what it takes to lead the team

20:51.190 --> 20:52.580
and work with the joint sponsor team

20:52.580 --> 20:55.180
to properly resolve
the issue of the re-audit.

20:56.620 --> 20:57.400
Remember:

20:57.720 --> 20:59.580
the previous falsification
was done for profit.

20:59.580 --> 21:00.970
Now we need to set things right,

21:00.970 --> 21:02.770
prioritize the bigger picture
over short-term gains,

21:02.770 --> 21:04.280
and do it properly.

21:06.010 --> 21:08.940
As long as our hotel group
successfully goes public,

21:09.100 --> 21:10.030
everything else

21:10.880 --> 21:11.830
is secondary.

21:14.180 --> 21:16.180
Thank you for your trust, Chairman.

21:18.620 --> 21:19.530
Let's hope so.

21:21.410 --> 21:22.690
Let's hope Shiyu...

21:23.620 --> 21:24.880
hasn't misjudged you.

22:24.760 --> 22:25.420
Uncle Liao,

22:26.040 --> 22:28.570
we should really
have a proper match someday.

22:29.940 --> 22:30.620
Me?

22:31.590 --> 22:33.120
I only have brute strength.

22:33.390 --> 22:34.660
To play golf well,

22:34.890 --> 22:36.580
you have to learn how to strategize

22:36.580 --> 22:37.710
and plot the course.

22:37.970 --> 22:38.600
That's

22:38.850 --> 22:40.800
your strong suit, kid.

22:40.930 --> 22:41.900
I'm no good.

22:41.920 --> 22:43.690
A computer
plots the courses better than I do.

22:43.690 --> 22:46.180
But if you can't hit the ball,
all the planning is useless.

22:46.180 --> 22:48.110
My back's too stiff.
I can't rotate properly.

22:48.110 --> 22:49.290
Sometimes I don't even want to
get on the course,

22:49.290 --> 22:51.000
afraid people will hurry me along.

22:51.000 --> 22:52.200
Stop being so modest.

22:53.150 --> 22:53.610
Come on.

22:55.300 --> 22:56.830
I have to toast you.

22:58.070 --> 23:01.270
People nowadays are
just different from our generation.

23:01.580 --> 23:03.920
They agree to something

23:04.060 --> 23:05.920
and then flip on it just like that.

23:07.080 --> 23:08.940
I wouldn't dare. I wouldn't dare.

23:10.580 --> 23:11.750
You wouldn't dare?

23:17.040 --> 23:18.900
Last time we met, you knew perfectly well

23:18.900 --> 23:20.290
that I hoped you would

23:20.320 --> 23:22.830
help ensure the successful listing of

23:22.860 --> 23:24.390
my Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

23:24.880 --> 23:25.880
But what happened?

23:25.880 --> 23:27.830
Do you think you're too smart?

23:27.940 --> 23:28.810
I bet

23:29.420 --> 23:32.550
you discovered my hotel group's
off-balance-sheet assets issue

23:32.550 --> 23:34.550
long ago.

23:35.280 --> 23:36.280
That girl Qian Fei

23:36.310 --> 23:38.060
was just a tool you used

23:38.400 --> 23:41.730
to expose this matter.

23:41.760 --> 23:43.360
Uncle Liao, the way you put it

23:44.040 --> 23:44.630
makes it sound like

23:44.630 --> 23:46.320
I was taking advantage of a young girl.

23:46.320 --> 23:48.220
It was all just work, Uncle Liao.

23:48.520 --> 23:51.470
So Qian Fei is just a paid worker.

23:51.490 --> 23:52.600
As for me...

23:53.990 --> 23:55.370
I won't explain further.

23:55.370 --> 23:57.230
I'm here today just to apologize.

23:57.390 --> 23:59.680
I'll accept whatever punishment
you see fit.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.550
Enough.

24:02.520 --> 24:04.180
You've cornered me like this.

24:04.480 --> 24:06.410
How can I keep pursuing the matter?

24:06.820 --> 24:08.600
You went through all this trouble

24:08.600 --> 24:09.790
and put in so much effort.

24:09.790 --> 24:11.720
Didn't you just want to tell me that

24:11.780 --> 24:13.230
whether my hotel group's

24:13.290 --> 24:15.390
IPO succeeds or fails,

24:15.540 --> 24:18.600
you can control the outcome either way?
Isn't that right?

24:18.600 --> 24:19.360
Uncle Liao,

24:20.730 --> 24:22.840
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

24:23.150 --> 24:24.280
is your life's work—

24:24.620 --> 24:25.650
your child.

24:25.760 --> 24:27.560
I understand that very clearly.

24:27.860 --> 24:29.390
Its successful listing

24:29.410 --> 24:30.800
is your greatest wish.

24:31.160 --> 24:32.560
But we sponsors

24:33.080 --> 24:35.110
are the doctors you hired for your child,

24:35.110 --> 24:35.960
aren't we?

24:36.080 --> 24:37.760
It's our responsibility to
remove the tumors

24:37.760 --> 24:39.230
that have to be removed.

24:39.770 --> 24:42.040
But when I tried to
discuss this with you directly,

24:42.040 --> 24:42.770
you refused.

24:43.000 --> 24:45.300
You even used Fulaxida to pressure me

24:45.580 --> 24:47.380
into helping cover up the fraud.

24:48.220 --> 24:50.350
I really couldn't do that, Uncle Liao.

24:50.480 --> 24:52.410
The law doesn't allow me to either.

24:52.580 --> 24:53.440
Chairman Liao,

24:54.250 --> 24:56.640
I believe Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

24:56.660 --> 24:59.060
is an exceptionally outstanding company.

24:59.070 --> 25:00.770
Restating the financial statements will,

25:00.770 --> 25:02.880
in the short term,
harm some shareholders' interests,

25:02.880 --> 25:04.320
but in the long run,

25:05.050 --> 25:07.450
there is far greater potential for growth.

25:07.800 --> 25:08.860
Don't you think so?

25:10.630 --> 25:12.230
That's a nice speech and all.

25:12.280 --> 25:13.920
But you went ahead and blew this wide open

25:13.920 --> 25:15.850
without even giving me a heads-up.

25:18.710 --> 25:19.560
I heard

25:20.070 --> 25:22.140
the entire joint sponsor team is in chaos

25:22.140 --> 25:24.510
and still hasn't found a solution.

25:24.840 --> 25:25.360
Tell me,

25:25.560 --> 25:27.020
what exactly should we do?

25:27.630 --> 25:28.560
Here's the thing.

25:28.560 --> 25:30.590
I'll come up with a plan
as soon as possible.

25:30.590 --> 25:32.720
I'm only waiting for one word from you.

25:32.750 --> 25:34.350
As long as you agree to give up

25:34.560 --> 25:39.290
those interest-based relationships that
should've been upheld in the first place.

25:55.710 --> 25:56.820
At this point...

25:58.730 --> 26:00.260
what other choice do I have?

26:05.080 --> 26:05.910
Yifei,

26:06.890 --> 26:10.940
please help ensure
that Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's

26:11.060 --> 26:12.120
IPO goes smoothly.

26:12.430 --> 26:13.100
Okay.

26:13.620 --> 26:14.340
Bottoms up.

26:16.420 --> 26:17.230
What a pity.

26:17.700 --> 26:19.360
Why didn't Shiyu find someone

26:19.360 --> 26:21.340
with your kind of boldness and vision?

26:21.340 --> 26:21.990
Oh, right.

26:22.530 --> 26:24.130
Shiyu definitely doesn't know

26:24.130 --> 26:25.780
you're Li Qiansheng's son.

26:27.330 --> 26:29.330
You're something, kid,

26:29.360 --> 26:31.160
keeping that hidden for so long.

26:31.640 --> 26:32.150
Then...

26:32.260 --> 26:34.230
Then, Uncle Liao, you need to
keep this secret for me.

26:34.230 --> 26:35.330
If you

26:35.350 --> 26:36.230
go and blow this for me,

26:36.230 --> 26:38.230
I can't guarantee your hotel group

26:38.230 --> 26:39.890
will successfully go public.

26:40.960 --> 26:42.380
Then I can't guarantee

26:42.430 --> 26:45.280
that Fulaxida's core team will return.

26:45.550 --> 26:46.210
Well, well.

26:46.260 --> 26:47.650
Can't beat a seasoned veteran.

26:47.650 --> 26:48.420
No,

26:48.730 --> 26:52.170
it's that the student
has surpassed the master.

27:13.850 --> 27:14.780
Narcissist.

27:15.080 --> 27:16.790
[Investment Due Diligence]

27:21.150 --> 27:22.280
[Li Yifei]

27:22.620 --> 27:22.860
[IB Notes]

27:25.650 --> 27:26.310
[Zhizhong Investment: Zhongda Games
Due Diligence Report—Project Summary]

27:29.330 --> 27:31.540
[Management Forecasts]
[Pro Forma Adjusted Forecasts]

27:33.450 --> 27:34.480
[Management Forecasts]
[Pro Forma Adjusted Forecasts]

27:35.900 --> 27:36.470
[Management Forecasts]
[Pro Forma Adjusted Forecasts]

27:51.240 --> 27:52.630
[Management Forecasts]
[Pro Forma Adjusted Forecasts]

27:55.470 --> 27:57.210
The project Li Yifei worked on
two years ago

27:57.210 --> 27:59.320
actually became a textbook case study.

27:59.320 --> 28:00.170
That impressive?

28:00.170 --> 28:01.010
Director Li,

28:01.520 --> 28:03.580
here are the materials you asked for.

28:14.890 --> 28:16.280
Look at this data.

28:16.710 --> 28:18.150
It shows that Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's

28:18.150 --> 28:19.280
previous commercial IP strategy

28:19.280 --> 28:20.260
failed.

28:20.540 --> 28:22.880
Its midscale hotel business,
once firmly established in the market,

28:22.880 --> 28:24.520
has now been pushed out of the top tier.

28:24.520 --> 28:27.050
Financing, number of new hotels,
gross margins—

28:24.700 --> 28:25.840
[Office Area]

28:27.080 --> 28:28.990
Shan Li Fang is falling behind
across the board.

28:28.990 --> 28:32.150
You knew all that
just by glancing at the table of contents?

28:32.150 --> 28:32.780
Get back to work.

28:32.780 --> 28:33.460
Okay.

28:34.850 --> 28:36.470
That spoiled young master

28:35.900 --> 28:39.310
[Investment Due Diligence]

28:36.500 --> 28:38.030
really knows his business.

28:38.990 --> 28:39.430
Zheng.

28:39.430 --> 28:40.790
He only skimmed
the contents page of the report

28:39.550 --> 28:41.870
[Office Area]

28:40.790 --> 28:42.850
and zeroed in on the key information.

28:42.950 --> 28:45.150
No wonder he's
a top-tier sponsor representative,

28:45.150 --> 28:46.670
and I only get to do the grunt work.

28:46.670 --> 28:48.230
For the revenue composition

28:48.230 --> 28:50.370
and expense analysis sections,
downplay the less favorable points.

28:50.370 --> 28:52.230
Focus on the operating profit margin.

28:52.230 --> 28:54.280
Emphasize that the 60% occupancy rate

28:54.280 --> 28:55.590
is the break-even threshold.

28:55.590 --> 28:57.350
High occupancy, high RevPAR,

28:57.250 --> 28:58.190
[Office Area]

28:57.380 --> 28:58.310
and high profit.

28:58.370 --> 29:00.160
Also mention the impact of commissions

29:00.160 --> 29:01.550
and the contribution of franchising.

29:01.550 --> 29:03.120
Excluding allocated hotel management

29:03.120 --> 29:04.150
and marketing expenses,

29:04.150 --> 29:05.210
self-owned, directly operated hotels

29:05.210 --> 29:07.140
achieve a profit margin of over 28%.

29:07.140 --> 29:08.200
That's all for now.

29:08.950 --> 29:09.580
Okay.

29:29.750 --> 29:31.210
This part needs revising.

29:44.620 --> 29:45.300
Done.

29:45.770 --> 29:47.570
Ask me if you have any questions.

30:01.140 --> 30:02.150
[I am handsome, but disciple, it's not]

30:02.170 --> 30:03.720
[proper to stare at me
like that so openly.]

30:11.230 --> 30:12.930
Only by studying hard

30:12.960 --> 30:15.010
can I become the person I want to be.

30:15.590 --> 30:16.970
Keep it up, Qian Fei.

30:24.810 --> 30:25.740
Why are you here?

30:27.520 --> 30:28.980
My dad talked to you today?

30:33.100 --> 30:34.960
It was about the accounts, right?

30:36.090 --> 30:36.760
Sit first.

30:44.660 --> 30:45.730
He must've given you a hard time.

30:45.730 --> 30:46.680
So annoying.

30:46.810 --> 30:47.880
He covered up

30:47.910 --> 30:49.770
the hotel group's data fraud himself.

30:49.770 --> 30:52.040
Now that his original plan
has fallen apart,

30:52.040 --> 30:53.440
he's taking it out on you.

30:54.600 --> 30:55.470
Don't be upset.

30:56.220 --> 30:57.490
In a few days,

30:58.150 --> 30:59.410
I'll help you piss him off.

30:59.410 --> 31:00.470
Don't be childish.

31:00.860 --> 31:02.520
After all, he is the chairman.

31:02.710 --> 31:04.770
He's the one
who sets the overall direction.

31:04.770 --> 31:06.250
So whatever decisions he makes,

31:06.250 --> 31:07.650
he must have his reasons.

31:07.670 --> 31:08.720
Honestly,

31:10.480 --> 31:12.480
with Qian Fei exposing all of that,

31:13.300 --> 31:15.150
-I do feel pretty bad about it.
-You always like to take responsibility

31:15.150 --> 31:16.970
for things that aren't your fault.

31:16.970 --> 31:19.510
Qian Fei just happens to
work for He Jing Securities.

31:19.510 --> 31:21.210
Choosing He Jing Securities
as the lead underwriter

31:21.210 --> 31:22.470
was my dad's decision.

31:22.550 --> 31:23.610
Well, who else's fault is that?

31:23.610 --> 31:24.260
Besides,

31:24.740 --> 31:26.830
my dad and I have different philosophies.

31:26.830 --> 31:29.000
I want the hotel group's IPO

31:29.020 --> 31:30.800
to be completely clean and transparent.

31:30.800 --> 31:32.460
This is a great era of capital.

31:32.620 --> 31:35.390
My goal is for the hotel group

31:35.660 --> 31:36.910
to ride that wave

31:36.940 --> 31:39.400
and grow into
an international enterprise.

31:39.440 --> 31:41.110
Not to go public

31:41.130 --> 31:42.060
just so my father

31:42.090 --> 31:44.210
and his old crowd can cash out.

31:46.040 --> 31:47.240
You'd never know it.

31:47.860 --> 31:49.210
In everyday life,

31:49.230 --> 31:50.650
you're as gentle as a little cat.

31:50.650 --> 31:52.120
But when it comes to work,

31:52.320 --> 31:53.580
you're like a cheetah.

31:55.390 --> 31:56.300
I'm serious.

31:57.210 --> 31:58.300
My dad will grow old

31:58.360 --> 31:59.190
and retire.

31:59.990 --> 32:00.750
I will be

32:00.770 --> 32:03.100
the owner of the hotel group
in the future.

32:03.410 --> 32:06.270
And I don't want it to have
a black mark on its record.

32:06.990 --> 32:09.270
Although Qian Fei is your ex-girlfriend,

32:09.270 --> 32:11.140
I judge people fairly.

32:12.000 --> 32:12.860
She's capable.

32:13.780 --> 32:15.440
Honestly, I'm grateful to her

32:16.320 --> 32:18.790
for helping us
uncover those hidden risks early.

32:18.790 --> 32:19.860
Alright, alright.

32:19.890 --> 32:21.280
Whatever you say,

32:21.530 --> 32:22.010
okay?

32:23.480 --> 32:25.540
Good instinct—you caught that fast.

32:25.570 --> 32:28.230
You don't fall for it
even when I try to trick you.

32:30.120 --> 32:32.880
I heard that woman, Qian Fei,
was fired by us before

32:32.880 --> 32:34.060
and then used every means possible

32:34.060 --> 32:36.860
to get herself onto the project team
for our hotel group.

32:36.860 --> 32:38.720
Who knows who she's really after?

33:02.270 --> 33:03.000
Qian Fei.

33:04.160 --> 33:06.010
Could you help me buy some medicine?

33:06.010 --> 33:06.940
Are you okay?

33:07.240 --> 33:09.580
I've had too much work lately.

33:09.610 --> 33:10.760
I've been pulling all-nighters,

33:10.760 --> 33:12.600
and I think my old condition
is flaring up again.

33:12.600 --> 33:13.460
Sure.

33:13.480 --> 33:14.620
Send me the names of the medications.

33:14.620 --> 33:15.520
I'll go get them for you now.

33:15.520 --> 33:16.980
Okay, thank you.

33:17.010 --> 33:18.410
-No problem.
-Thank you.

33:38.340 --> 33:38.950
Hello,

33:38.970 --> 33:40.910
do you have these three medicines?

33:41.100 --> 33:42.030
No.

33:42.380 --> 33:42.970
No.

33:42.990 --> 33:43.750
Thank you.

33:43.770 --> 33:44.370
Take care.

33:45.380 --> 33:45.910
Here.

33:46.480 --> 33:48.940
Go through these materials this afternoon.

33:48.970 --> 33:49.450
Here.

33:49.470 --> 33:50.270
Okay, okay.

33:51.060 --> 33:53.150
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group...

33:53.530 --> 33:56.030
[Office Area]

33:53.780 --> 33:54.420
Boss.

33:55.240 --> 33:56.240
Where is Qian Fei?

33:56.310 --> 33:57.640
Her phone is turned off.

33:58.320 --> 33:59.660
I don't know where she went.

33:59.660 --> 34:01.330
I saw her go out at noon.

34:01.910 --> 34:03.370
Went out? Where did she go?

34:04.970 --> 34:06.570
Maybe she went out for lunch?

34:06.770 --> 34:09.370
[Office Area]

34:08.550 --> 34:09.540
It's past 2:00 PM already.

34:09.540 --> 34:11.400
What kind of meal takes this long?

34:13.639 --> 34:14.880
Alright, when she comes back,

34:14.880 --> 34:16.739
tell her to come see me immediately.

34:16.739 --> 34:17.409
Got it.

34:18.500 --> 34:21.270
[Office Area]

34:22.199 --> 34:23.050
Where have you been?

34:23.050 --> 34:24.510
I couldn't find you anywhere.

34:24.510 --> 34:26.010
I went to buy medicine for Dai Xi.

34:26.010 --> 34:29.260
[Office Area]

34:32.030 --> 34:34.130
Leaving your post without permission
during work hours—

34:34.130 --> 34:35.389
who gave you the nerve?

34:37.120 --> 34:38.980
You're my special assistant now.

34:39.199 --> 34:40.980
During working hours,
you are to be on standby at all times

34:40.980 --> 34:42.860
and keep your phone on 24/7.

34:43.090 --> 34:45.420
You don't even know something this basic?

34:47.639 --> 34:48.429
I'm telling you,

34:48.429 --> 34:50.429
don't think you're just sitting around
with nothing to do.

34:50.429 --> 34:51.110
The reason we have you on standby

34:51.110 --> 34:52.760
is so that Director Fang and I

34:52.760 --> 34:54.620
can find you whenever we need you.

34:54.760 --> 34:56.620
From now on,
anything outside the scope of your duties

34:56.620 --> 34:57.600
is off-limits!

34:58.670 --> 34:59.670
Understood?

35:00.810 --> 35:01.750
Understood.

35:05.720 --> 35:07.070
The files in your email—

35:07.200 --> 35:08.070
print, format, and bind them.

35:08.070 --> 35:09.630
Bring them to me in 15 minutes.

35:09.630 --> 35:12.250
[Office Area]

35:20.010 --> 35:23.140
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group;
Director's Office]

35:22.420 --> 35:23.020
Come in.

35:26.780 --> 35:27.920
Here are the materials you asked for.

35:27.920 --> 35:28.990
I've formatted and bound them.

35:28.990 --> 35:30.320
Good. Leave them there.

35:30.980 --> 35:32.310
Is there anything else?

35:33.400 --> 35:34.000
Yes.

35:36.050 --> 35:37.140
Did you

35:37.280 --> 35:38.280
have lunch today?

35:41.280 --> 35:42.360
If there's nothing else,

35:42.360 --> 35:43.560
I'll get back to work.

35:43.760 --> 35:44.910
Aren't you hungry?

35:46.110 --> 35:46.940
Come back.

35:50.810 --> 35:51.330
Sit.

36:14.310 --> 36:14.640
Eat.

36:15.500 --> 36:16.630
It's work hours now.

36:16.680 --> 36:17.390
That's right.

36:17.390 --> 36:18.840
And this is the task I'm assigning you.

36:18.840 --> 36:19.320
Eat.

36:22.390 --> 36:22.920
Alright.

36:32.550 --> 36:33.470
Running errands for others

36:33.470 --> 36:34.550
while starving yourself—

36:34.550 --> 36:35.720
aren't you an idiot?

36:37.340 --> 36:38.580
Slow down.

36:38.730 --> 36:39.720
Look how hungry you are.

36:39.720 --> 36:42.050
Aren't you going to thank me, your master?

36:44.660 --> 36:45.900
I ran errands

36:45.920 --> 36:47.560
to get some exercise.

36:47.580 --> 36:49.320
And I'm not hungry at all right now.

36:49.320 --> 36:51.300
I'm only eating because I'm completing
the task you assigned me.

36:51.300 --> 36:52.420
Yes, yes, yes.

36:53.030 --> 36:55.080
No one's assigned me a task to eat.

36:55.100 --> 36:56.390
I haven't eaten either.

36:56.390 --> 36:57.450
You haven't eaten?

36:58.220 --> 36:59.700
Then hurry up and have some.

36:59.700 --> 37:01.690
I skipped lunch
because I was busy working.

37:01.690 --> 37:02.790
You think I'm like you,

37:02.790 --> 37:04.560
running around doing favors for others
with nothing better to do?

37:04.560 --> 37:06.310
Do you think I wanted to be idle?

37:08.250 --> 37:09.000
Just eat.

37:10.840 --> 37:11.730
Do you know

37:12.100 --> 37:15.010
that this sushi place is
the most famous in Lujiazui?

37:15.010 --> 37:17.340
You have to make reservations in advance.

37:18.100 --> 37:20.320
I should've been sitting
in the restaurant,

37:20.320 --> 37:22.720
listening to music and enjoying it slowly.

37:23.270 --> 37:25.220
Instead, here I am eating it
with you like this.

37:25.220 --> 37:26.480
Don't tell me how much it costs.

37:26.480 --> 37:28.610
Otherwise, I won't be able to enjoy it.

37:38.210 --> 37:39.870
You two are really digging in.

37:41.260 --> 37:42.570
I'm heading over to see Ms. Liao,

37:42.570 --> 37:45.010
so there are a few things
I need to discuss with you first.

37:45.010 --> 37:45.530
Sure.

37:48.650 --> 37:51.190
Special Assistant Qian's perks
are pretty good.

37:51.190 --> 37:53.120
This is from Zhufeng Sushi, right?

37:53.130 --> 37:53.860
Good eye.

37:55.230 --> 37:55.830
Is that so?

37:56.030 --> 37:56.510
Then...

37:57.630 --> 37:59.060
Director Fang, Director Li,
you two carry on.

37:59.060 --> 37:59.950
I'll get back to work.

37:59.950 --> 38:00.510
Okay.

38:04.080 --> 38:05.610
Have a seat, Director Fang.

38:06.890 --> 38:07.660
How is she?

38:08.590 --> 38:10.170
Qian Fei is doing alright at work?

38:10.170 --> 38:12.030
I heard you criticized her today.

38:13.720 --> 38:14.720
Nothing serious.

38:15.180 --> 38:16.330
Mainly, it was me

38:16.360 --> 38:17.620
being a bit impatient.

38:18.070 --> 38:19.330
She's doing a good job.

38:48.510 --> 38:49.910
You're dressed like this

38:49.910 --> 38:50.910
for work?

38:51.970 --> 38:53.540
Looking presentable

38:53.570 --> 38:55.700
is my way of showing respect for my job.

38:56.370 --> 38:58.000
But when we went to
the subdistrict office yesterday,

38:58.000 --> 38:59.860
they said you didn't come to work.

39:00.410 --> 39:01.840
You went to the subdistrict office?

39:01.840 --> 39:02.490
Yeah.

39:04.030 --> 39:05.390
To support your work,

39:05.390 --> 39:06.470
we specifically went there

39:06.470 --> 39:07.420
to volunteer for assignments.

39:07.420 --> 39:07.960
Right.

39:08.120 --> 39:09.980
They said you got a day off in lieu.

39:10.040 --> 39:11.080
They got it wrong.

39:11.240 --> 39:12.900
I was out in the field that day.

39:13.520 --> 39:14.890
Where were you working in the field?

39:14.890 --> 39:16.630
At the Financial Center?

39:17.470 --> 39:18.800
You know that too?

39:20.170 --> 39:22.010
You know Auntie Fang from Lane 3, right?

39:22.010 --> 39:23.700
She works as a cleaner

39:23.730 --> 39:25.780
at that financial center now.

39:26.030 --> 39:27.860
She said she saw you there that day,

39:27.860 --> 39:29.830
waiting outside for a young woman.

39:29.940 --> 39:32.700
Then security wouldn't let you in,

39:32.960 --> 39:35.610
and you even ended up on their blacklist.

39:35.840 --> 39:37.310
Strange, isn't it?

39:38.270 --> 39:39.130
What happened?

39:40.160 --> 39:41.930
There was a misunderstanding at the time.

39:41.930 --> 39:43.930
I forgot to bring my work ID that day.

39:45.370 --> 39:48.000
Well, make sure you don't forget it today.

39:48.020 --> 39:49.160
W-Where is your work ID?

39:49.160 --> 39:50.580
Let me see. Where is it?

39:51.020 --> 39:52.110
Did you bring it?

39:55.410 --> 39:57.740
Fire Safety Inspection.

39:57.770 --> 39:58.210
Right.

39:59.080 --> 40:00.870
This inspection uses

40:00.900 --> 40:03.050
a cross-deployment model where personnel
are shuffled across different districts.

40:03.050 --> 40:05.690
I'm the only one
from our office participating.

40:05.690 --> 40:07.470
You volunteered for it, right?

40:08.800 --> 40:11.990
The district office called for
better fire safety supervision

40:11.990 --> 40:13.470
and wider public education
on fire prevention.

40:13.470 --> 40:15.270
I simply responded positively.

40:15.510 --> 40:16.240
Very civic-minded of you.

40:16.240 --> 40:17.440
Truly civic-minded.

40:18.350 --> 40:19.820
Keep eating. I'm off.

40:20.300 --> 40:21.270
Okay, go, go.

40:27.840 --> 40:28.640
Where is my phone?

40:28.640 --> 40:29.220
Hand me my phone.

40:29.220 --> 40:29.800
There.

40:32.360 --> 40:32.880
Here.

40:34.230 --> 40:35.560
What are you going to do?

40:36.010 --> 40:37.070
Didn't you notice?

40:37.140 --> 40:38.540
According to his work ID,

40:38.620 --> 40:41.200
it was issued yesterday.

40:41.340 --> 40:43.110
It was just issued yesterday.

40:45.440 --> 40:46.520
That means

40:46.550 --> 40:49.150
he didn't go to
the Financial Center yesterday

40:49.160 --> 40:49.950
for work.

40:49.970 --> 40:52.230
He went there to see that girl, didn't he?

40:54.080 --> 40:55.290
That little rascal.

40:57.880 --> 40:59.590
I-Is this Fang?

41:32.870 --> 41:36.350
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

41:44.780 --> 41:45.600
Hold on.

41:45.630 --> 41:46.770
You can't go in.

41:48.490 --> 41:49.220
Sir,

41:49.250 --> 41:51.180
it was a misunderstanding before.

41:51.510 --> 41:52.640
I have my ID now.

41:51.590 --> 41:52.490
[Fire Inspection]

41:53.830 --> 41:55.250
Jun, what are you doing?

41:55.280 --> 41:56.080
Time to split into groups.

41:56.080 --> 41:57.940
See? My supervisor is calling me.

42:00.820 --> 42:01.380
Thank you.

42:01.380 --> 42:02.220
I'm coming.

42:07.320 --> 42:08.510
Wang, Li, Bin,

42:08.510 --> 42:10.510
you three take floors 20 through 27.

42:10.840 --> 42:11.390
Jun,

42:11.430 --> 42:12.550
you, Chen, Song, and I

42:12.550 --> 42:14.110
will take floors 28 and 29.

42:15.190 --> 42:16.880
I take floors 28 and 29?

42:17.740 --> 42:19.070
Got a problem with that?

42:19.200 --> 42:19.760
No.

42:19.920 --> 42:20.450
Alright.

42:20.500 --> 42:21.150
Let's go.

42:37.330 --> 42:39.020
Hello, fire inspection?

42:39.140 --> 42:40.140
This way, please.

42:41.800 --> 42:42.360
Dang...

42:51.930 --> 42:53.680
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

43:01.950 --> 43:02.510
Let's go.

43:04.420 --> 43:06.830
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

43:04.520 --> 43:05.090
Let's go.

43:05.120 --> 43:07.290
I keep feeling like
I've left something behind.

43:07.290 --> 43:08.890
Just can't settle my nerves.

43:09.950 --> 43:10.500
It's fine.

43:10.500 --> 43:11.830
Wait for me. Wait for me.

43:12.070 --> 43:12.920
Thank you.

43:13.880 --> 43:16.050
Simply put,

43:16.420 --> 43:17.390
if you want to pursue her,

43:17.390 --> 43:19.320
you need to have thick enough skin.

43:19.700 --> 43:21.140
Then, did you manage to win Qian Fei over?
